osmnxr is a port to R of OSMnx
==============================

osmnxr is a translation to R (with a Rust compute core) of OSMnx, the Python
library created and maintained by Geoff Boeing
(https://github.com/gboeing/osmnx). The public interface, the modelling
choices (network types, topology simplification, intersection consolidation,
urban metrics, default settings) and the Overpass query filters of osmnxr are
those of OSMnx; the filters in R/utils.R reproduce OSMnx's tag for tag. The
intellectual contribution of that design is Geoff Boeing's. Please cite:

  Boeing, G. (2025). Modeling and Analyzing Urban Networks and Amenities with
  OSMnx. Geographical Analysis, 57(4), 567-577. doi:10.1111/gean.70009

